From cfe451a8f04d0d76944b8ab9e3673a19ec659a84 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mkinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 23:35:19 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] fix(sinker): judge body electrodes against cavity
 outlines

Compare body electrodes with cavity wall offsets.
Preserve the floor and orbit checks.
Keep the existing size law when the outline is absent.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #1810
